# CLARION CALL: the three goals. Beacon: get the Homing Charm (here bought
# at the Arboretum's stall for 100, with real presses). Saucer: fly home
# with Ansel (beat Lady Hush with all three Hush Engines broken; the bad
# ending earns nothing). Alien: stop Grandsire Tock (it earns the Saucer
# too, as Ansel comes home that way as well). Goals are kept for good.
seed 1
game clarion
wait 10
expect goals == 0
cheat area 1 0
wait 2
cheat coins 150
cheat enter_room 8
wait 2
expect item_a0 == 11
expect item_price0 == 100
cheat sub_place 88 144
wait 5
press A 10
wait 30
expect has11 == 1
expect coins == 50
expect goals == 1
reload
game clarion
wait 10
expect goals == 1
# the Saucer, then the Alien
cheat area 6 2
wait 2
cheat engines 7
cheat escape 2
wait 2
cheat place 160 30
hold A 30
wait 2
expect goals == 3
cheat area 6 2
wait 2
cheat escape 3
wait 2
cheat place 160 30
hold A 30
wait 2
expect goals == 7
